"Usage: mevcine [--simple | --expert] [-d (1-3) | --debug=(1-3)] [video | project]\n"
"   starts MeVCine, for the kinematic study of videos\n"
"   --simple, -s: start directly in simple mode (step by step)\n"
"   --expert, -e: start directly in expert mode\n"
"   -d or --debug=: more or less verbose debug messages (1 to 3)\n"
"   optional argument: a video, or a project (.mevcine, .cinemev, .mecavideo)"

